# Flight Reservation System - Java

## Description

A simple Java application for booking flight seats.

## Features

- Display flight details
- Book seats
- Check remaining seats
- Simple testbench

## Technologies

- Java
- Scanner
- Methods

## Run

Compile:

javac FlightReservationSystem.java FlightReservationTest.java

Run:

java FlightReservationSystem

Test:

java FlightReservationTest

## Output

===== FLIGHT RESERVATION =====
Flight: AI101
Route: Hyderabad -> Delhi
Available Seats: 10

Enter seats to book: 3
Booking Successful!
Remaining Seats: 7

## Testbench

Test 1: PASS
Test 2: PASS
